# Red mob (RedMob, 2026-11-21): native 48x32 frames, facing right, feet on row 31, the body within x 5..24. A hooded whip
# brigand: hood and tunic in dark wine m with folds d and scarlet lights R, the face a shadow n with two glowing eyes e,
# charcoal trousers g/G, leather boots, belt and glove l/L with a bone buckle B, and a bone whip lash b. Exported by
# tools/enemy_sprites.py into assets/images/enemy/Mobs.png in the cells RedMob.java reads (sprite_layouts.ENEMY_SHEETS).
# idle1..4: the ready stance, the lash on the floor (the hood sinks a pixel, the lash sways); run1..4: stride, pass, stride,
# pass, the lash coiled in the hand; windup1, windup2: the wind-up (the whip raised in front, then cocked behind the hood,
# the eyes flaring white W); strike: the lash out to x 31 (the attack box ends at x 32) with a crack and its arc; recover:
# the lash falling in front; hit, flash, fall, down: the death (recoil, a white flash, knees, face down); down is also
# the body it leaves (D101, #478), resting on row 31.
# Danger family, its own red: wine 6c0014 and scarlet f80440 (0.11 from the hero's headband c22a24 and 0.25 from the
# beetle's 86101f), so the brigand reads red and apart from the crimson-and-rose beetle, spider and snail. The moon rim
# (D92) lights the ink contour on export.
size 48 32
color k 0b0814
color d 3a0010
color m 6c0014
color R f80440
color n 1a1016
color e ff6b57
color g 2c2430
color G 4a4048
color l 5c3a2a
color L 7a4a30
color b b8a898
color B d0c4b8
color W ffffff
